{"availability":"available","full":"cg1290-tech/voucherguard","name":"voucherguard","description":"Verify what your AI agents sign. Offline verification for Solana payment channel vouchers: TypeScript SDK, CLI and static playground.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-08T07:18:55Z","updated":"2026-10-16T09:10:52Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://cg1290-tech.github.io/voucherguard/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T15:48:41.790Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T15:48:41.790Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T15:48:41.790Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:34:17.266Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T17:28:07.446Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T15:48:41.790Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An offline, open-source verification toolkit for Solana Foundation payment channel V1 vouchers. Decode the exact signed message, verify Ed25519 against an independently trusted public key, enforce application policies, and compare cumulative authorization against a supplied trusted channel snapshot.","AI agents can authorize spending. A valid signature alone does not establish that the authorization matches your channel, budget, clock or settlement watermark. VoucherGuard makes those checks explicit and reviewable.","No backend, RPC, wallet connection, private-key collection, payment execution, telemetry or AI inference. Not an agent platform. Not a full x402 verifier. Not independently audited."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cg1290-tech/voucherguard/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9cd8b590a6a87f57de0dfbde8c287f05d0a61e298872f510743e150b9140f007","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T07:34:17.516Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:34:17.516Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An offline, open-source verification toolkit for Solana Foundation payment